15</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:28\" href=\"/Judges.5.28\">Ju 5:28</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.12\">1 S 19:12</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.16\">2 S 6:16</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.29\">1 Ch 15:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:30\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.30\">2 K 9:30</a> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:9\" href=\"/Joel.2.9\">Jo 2:9</a>; <em>latticed windows</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.4\">1 K 6:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.16\">Ez 40:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.16\">41:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.26\">26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בּח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:18\" href=\"/Joshua.2.18\">Jos 2:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:21\" href=\"/Joshua.2.21\">21</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.6\">Pr 7:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:14\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.14\">Zp 2:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל־הח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:32\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.32\">2 K 9:32</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן־הח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:9\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.9\">Ct 2:9</a>; <em>windows</em> of palace, <span dir=\"rtl\">קָרַע לוֹ חַלּוֹנָי(ו)</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.14\">Je 22:14</a> <em>cutteth him out his windows;</em> of the gates of Ezek.’s temple <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.16\">Ez 40:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.25\">25</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.29\">29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:33\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.33\">33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:36\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.36\">36</a>, of the temple itself <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.16\">Ez 41:16</a><sup>(×2)</sup>."}]},"rid":"BDB03099","strong_numbers":["2474"],"next_hw":"חָלִיל","prev_hw":"חַלָּה","all_cite